Makasih.

935
00:47:58,500 --> 00:47:59,543
Tas aku!

936
00:48:00,043 --> 00:48:02,212
Jangan biarkan para
bajak laut lolos dari sini!

937
00:48:02,838 --> 00:48:04,923
