979
00:50:37,159 --> 00:50:38,410
[mendengus]

980
00:50:39,202 --> 00:50:40,579
Dia punya buah iblis!

981
00:50:41,496 --> 00:50:43,707
Enggak masalah. Kita hajar dia.

982
00:50:43,790 --> 00:50:45,500
