984
00:50:48,086 --> 00:50:49,087
[riuh perkelahian]

985
00:50:59,639 --> 00:51:01,767
Gomu Gomu…

986
00:51:04,853 --> 00:51:06,813
Gatling!

987
00:51:06,897 --> 00:51:08,899
