- [berdesah] - Ayo.

1032
00:54:20,131 --> 00:54:21,131
Hei.

1033
00:54:21,883 --> 00:54:22,883
Ayo.

1034
00:54:25,178 --> 00:54:26,178
Ayo.

1035
00:54:33,311 --> 00:54:35,438
- Tadi ada apa di sana? - Enggak tahu.

1036
00:54:35,522 --> 00:54:38,400
Udah mau hujan. Zoro,
Usopp, turunin layarnya!

1037
00:54:38,483 --> 00:54:40,443
Orang yang nyelametin kamu, siapa dia?

1038
00:54:42,404 --> 00:54:43,488
Enggak tahu.

1039
