Ya.

1113
00:59:37,824 --> 00:59:39,867
Tapi semuanya bisa kita hadapin.

1114
00:59:40,618 --> 00:59:41,618
Bersama!

1115
00:59:42,453 --> 00:59:43,663
Grand Line,

1116
00:59:43,746 --> 00:59:47,041
